EDICT 0005: the frame-0 hash point in SV_SpawnServer

Category: harness hook, no change in results.
One call after ED_LoadFromFile: the state after spawn, before SV_SpawnServer's two settling SV_Physics calls and
SV_CreateBaseline, is the cut-2 gate (docs/PLAN.md section C, cut 2, step 4). Edict_Spawned (ref/src/edict_hash.c)
writes, with -edicthash, a map record and a spawn record with the lanes and one hash per edict, and with
-edictcapture a spawn record with what changed since the last spawn function; it only reads.
Checked when added: the per-frame hashes of all 10 R9 maps x 4,000 frames are identical with and without the patch,
and the captures are byte-identical apart from the cvar cmdline (the command line, which holds the output paths).

